                  "LocationAccuracy": "+/- 20m",
                  "YearOfSampling": null,
                  "DataSource": "Undertaken by CSIRO Sustainable Ecosystems and NSW Department of Primary Industries in 2007 as part of GRDC Project 'Training growers to manage soil water'",
                  "Comments": "Petroferric; Texture from PSA; EC, pH, Cl and OC estimated below 120cm depth; Manganese and Aluminium only analysed when pH below 5.5 (1:5); CLL measured for oats, all others estimated",
                  "Name": "Methul",
